commit 19ab24ec43d99ddf46a0fce571619051ed59503d
Author: David Harris <David_Harris@hmc.edu>
Date:   Wed Sep 16 09:52:16 2026 -0700

    Gate mstateen0.CTR with a new SMCTR_SUPPORTED parameter
    
    Bit 54 of mstateen0 controls access to the control transfer records added by
    Smctr.  It was hardwired to zero; gate it like the other state bits so it becomes
    writable if Smctr is ever implemented.  SMCTR_SUPPORTED is zero in every config.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/config/rv32e/config.vh b/config/rv32e/config.vh
